year: 2026
version: "1.10.0"
abstract: >-
  A real-time MIDI instrument for human-AI performance. It listens,
  decides whether to answer, selects a musical character and performs a
  bounded response through an allow-listed MIDI router.
keywords:
  - human-AI performance
  - meta-listening
  - heautoscopy
  - generative music
  - MIDI
  - constrained agency
